{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a charming and competitive world where Teddy Bears run horse farms!<br>Players can buy horses from adorable teddy bear ranchers, breed them to create foals with better stats, and enter their best horses into thrilling races to win big prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each horse has unique attributes such as speed and stamina. With the right breeding strategy and smart investment decisions, you can raise champion racehorses, expand your ranch, and build your fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3b Interact with adorable Teddy Bear NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc0e Horse buying, selling, and breeding system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc7 Horses with unique stats and strategic breeding gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Real-time horse racing to earn money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Manage your economy to build the ultimate ranch</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957780?t=1773011987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957780?t=1773011987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957780/17f179a22f3cc265102d178db7054c14cf675a0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773011987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957780/17f179a22f3cc265102d178db7054c14cf675a0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773011987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a charming and competitive world where Teddy Bears run horse farms!<br>Players can buy horses from adorable teddy bear ranchers, breed them to cr